    "text": "KATV\nwebsite\nCrawford County, Arkansas\nGrowing number of Northwest Arkansas counties place moratoriums on wind farms\nBy Andrew Mobley,\n1 hours agoLITTLE ROCK (KATV) — A growing number of Northwest Arkansas counties are temporarily banning construction of wind farms—the latest, Crawford County. On Monday, the Crawford County Quorum Court passed a five-year moratorium on the construction of commercial wind turbines. \"Crawford county is where I-49 and I-40 intersect. Our...\n8",
